flowchart TD
    A[Start BFS from StartPos]
    A --> B[Queue + Visited]

    B --> C[Dequeue Current]
    C --> D{Is GoalPos?}

    D -->|Yes| E[Reconstruct Path]
    E --> F[Create GoalTracer]

    C --> G{Is Path Card & Not DeadEnd?}
    G -->|No| B

    G -->|Yes| H[Check 4 Directions]
    H --> I{Connections Match?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Enqueue Neighbor]
